# Project log

After each completed roadmap phase, append an entry to `docs/project_log.md` before ending the turn.

Create the file in Phase 1 if it is missing. Header: running log, newest entries first.

```markdown
## YYYY-MM-DD — Short title

**Phase:** Phase N
**Status:** Done

### What changed
- Concrete outcomes

### Experiment note
- Time spent:
- Comprehension (if this phase asks for it):
- Confusing part:
```

Do not rewrite older entries. Skip the log only when the work was a question with no file changes.
